// unicodedata 15.0, mirrored brackets, P2/P3, TooSmall and Invalid, and 150 lines
// of BidiCharacterTest.txt (Unicode 15.0; the UAX #9 worked examples, the 8.0
// clarifications, then every 705th line) resolving to the expected paragraph level,
// levels after L1 and visual order after L2, compared through one FNV-1a hash per
// line over the non-removed positions. The case data is a byte string written by
// the generator beside the Python replica: count, direction (2 = auto), paragraph
// level, 3-byte code points, 8-byte expected hash. Class checks exit 1..30, cases
// exit 100 + case.
